    "sections": {
        "description": "Business Analyst Coach is built with a structured layout that supports organised content presentation and flexible page creation. The theme includes responsive design, ensuring pages adjust smoothly across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. It offers customizable typography, colour settings, navigation menus, widget-ready areas, and homepage sections that can be arranged through the built-in Customizer. Logo upload, footer settings, and social media integration are also available for basic website personalization. The theme supports the block editor and is compatible with commonly used page-building tools for creating custom layouts without editing core files. It includes options for banners, featured content, testimonials, image galleries, service sections, and contact information. Standard compatibility with plugins for contact forms, SEO, caching, and performance enhancements allows additional functionality when needed. Translation-ready files support multilingual websites, while coding practices follow current development standards for easier maintenance and ongoing compatibility. Layouts, spacing, fonts, and colour schemes can be adjusted using available customization settings, helping maintain a consistent appearance across the website while allowing flexibility for different content structures and regular updates."
    },
